  "title": "Sinclair Names Carol Kellum Vice President and General Manager of KPTM in Omaha and KHGI/KFXL in Lincoln-Hastings-Kearney",
  "summary": "BALTIMORE – August 17, 2026 – Sinclair today announced that Carol Kellum has been named Vice President and General Manager of KPTM (FOX) in Omaha and KHGI (ABC) and KFXL (FOX) serving the Lincoln-Hastings-Kearney market. Kellum returns to Sinclair following the retirement of Vice President and General Manager John Hannon, who will retire at the...",
